{
  "title": "yummy chewy Canadian yam hash",
  "description": "funky, chewy, one-pot Canadian dish featuring curry powder, vegetarian-friendly, and a hint of smokiness from yakimono-grill. Perfect for a cozy dinner or lunch with friends.",
  "cuisine": "Canadian",
