      "name": "chopped fresh cilantro",
      "amount": "2 tbsp",
      "notes": "optional garnish"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "heat 1 tbsp olive oil in a large cast-iron skillet or Dutch oven over medium-high heat.",
    "add yams, onion, and garlic; cook, stirring occasionally, until the yams start to soften, about 10 minutes.",
    "add curry powder and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "add carrots and cook, stirring occasionally, for 5 minutes.",
    "add yakimono-grill seasoning, salt, and black pepper; stir to combine.",
    "grill the hash, covered, for 5-7 minutes per side, or until the yams are tender and slightly charred.",
    "remove from heat and garnish with chopped green onions and cilantro, if using.",
    "serve hot, straight from the grill.",
    "adjust seasoning to taste, if needed."
  ],
